<p><a href="training.pl">工作坊(Workshops)</a> 於 <a href="http://www.brc.cornell.edu/brcinfo/index.php?f=2">康乃爾蛋白質組學與質譜核心設施(Cornell Proteomics and Mass Spectrometry Core Facility)</a> 舉辦，講授蛋白質組學技術與方法(on proteomics technologies and techniques are given)。工作坊講義範例可在線取得(An example of the handouts from the workshop are available online)。(<a href="/documents/secretom/MSOct09WorkshopHandouts.pdf">pdf</a>)</p>
<p>植物基因組研究計畫暑期 <a href="http://bti.cornell.edu/pgrp/pgrp.php?id=201">實習生(interns)</a> 參與校園內各種基因組學相關活動，包括細胞壁蛋白質組學專案(participate in various genomics-associated activities on campus, including the cell wall proteomics project)。這包括對學生的實驗室實務培訓與課堂講座(This included practical lab-based training of students and classroom lectures)。</p>
